Package: alsdownloader
Title: Discover, Inspect and Download Airborne Laser Scanning Data
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: person("Cesar Ivan", "Alvites Diaz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "calvites1990@gmail.com")
Description: Discover, visualize and download airborne laser scanning data
    from an international catalogue through R functions and a 'Shiny'
    application. Spatial searches identify point-cloud tiles intersecting
    an area of interest and retain acquisition metadata, source citations
    and licence links. Supports three-dimensional visualization, visual
    comparison, download planning reports and transfers of original files.
    Integrates supported provider services and configured spatial indexes,
    including approved community contributions. Distinguishes integrated
    access from external portals; availability depends on provider coverage.
License: GPL-3
Contact: Cesar Ivan Alvites Diaz <calvites1990@gmail.com>
URL: https://cesarito2021.r-universe.dev/alsdownloader,
    https://github.com/Cesarito2021/als_downloader
BugReports: https://github.com/Cesarito2021/als_downloader/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
